<title>UK: UK meals/feeds closed little changed.</title>
<headline>UK meals/feeds closed little changed.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK meals and feeds closed little changed from Thursday's finish as currency factors and an uncertain start to the Chicago soybean meal futures stifled interest.</p>
<p>&quot;There's been little incentive to trade and with Chicago jumping about in early business, its a case of waiting for Monday and see where we go from there,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Soybean meal futures ended unchanged to 0.50 sterling lower.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8074</p>
</text>
